{
  "id": "RUN-z3-bv64-negamt",
  "title": "Over signed BitVec 64 the guard without amount > 0 lets the sender wrap negative; over Int a negative amount drains the recipient and never the sender",
  "task": "W1-T12",
  "origin": "recorded",
  "records": "S1.L5 segment 1 and the Defence's zero-or-negative item: signed BitVec 64 without amount > 0 lets A - X wrap below zero, and with it the same violation is unsat; the Int twin of z3_negamt.py gives sat for the recipient's drain, unsat for the sender, unsat for a change under a zero amount",
